        ["Web Development", "web developer|web development"],

        ["AI", "data engineer|data analyst|machine learning|machine learning engineer|ai engineer|artificial intelligence"],

        ["DevOps / Cloud", "devops|cloud engineer|site reliability|sre|platform engineer"],

        ["Other Engineering", "developer|engineer"]
